     "body": "<p>I think the corruption was caused by the Writer coercing the bytes into UTF-8, so I switched to using FileOutputStreams instead (which doesn't do anything that fancy):</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/36\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/36</a></p>",
